(text "RELAYS. Finder 40.31.7.012.0000. NOT FOR FABRICATION.\\nCoil table: 288 ohm, 42 mA at 12 V, pickup 8.8 V, max 18 V. Contact DC1 is 10 A resistive at 30 V DC.\\nDC13 life matches DC1 when a diode is fitted across the contactor coil, at the contactor, not on this PCB.\\nThe XOR and AND gates are removed. The cross-clamps stop both coils being commanded together. The series switch drops the coil return unless the heartbeat is fresh.\\nA welded contact is not opened by any of this." (at 20 265 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "9674c91d-2fa5-43c1-b9ab-345d89777e04"))
